1
00:00:00,076 --> 00:00:05,251
Makam Alexander Agung yang hilang 1.600
tahun diduga ditemukan di Mesir...

2
00:00:05,251 --> 00:00:06,509
dan konon,

3
00:00:06,509 --> 00:00:09,149
kaisar Romawi mematahkan hidung jasadnya!

4
00:00:09,149 --> 00:00:10,993
Kaisar Augustus menyentuhnya...

5
00:00:10,993 --> 00:00:11,334
krek,

6
00:00:11,334 --> 00:00:12,980
sepotong hidungnya patah!

7
00:00:12,980 --> 00:00:14,607
Lalu makamnya lenyap...

8
00:00:14,607 --> 00:00:16,045
berabad-abad dicari,

9
00:00:16,045 --> 00:00:16,982
tak ketemu.

10
00:00:16,982 --> 00:00:17,654
Kini,

11
00:00:17,654 --> 00:00:21,135
arkeolog Yunani menemukan fondasi
raksasa di bawah taman kota...

12
00:00:21,135 --> 00:00:22,554
diduga makam raja,

13
00:00:22,554 --> 00:00:24,901
tempat jasad Alexander dulu disemayamkan!

14
00:00:24,901 --> 00:00:26,345
Tapi jasadnya...

15
00:00:26,345 --> 00:00:27,455
masih di sana?

16
00:00:27,455 --> 00:00:27,890
Follow,

17
00:00:27,890 --> 00:00:29,980
besok ada yang lebih aneh.
